Rho’s agent loop, tool hooks, and streaming events are modeled on the MIT-licensed
Pi agent harness (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi) and on the public design of
OpenCode (https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode). This repository does not contain
source from those projects. It is a domain fork: the same harness ideas, rebuilt for
customer-facing enterprise workflows instead of coding agents.
